{"sha": "a836d6ca152ff026a172363c4167fea48d78785d682003f5275cd4ed2b496200", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.55\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g1-magnet-clips.jpg}", "", "{\\small 磁铁能吸起钢制回形针。桌上的铝制罐和", "铜片都留在原处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[漂浮与下沉]\\label{ex:g1:materials-around-us:float}", "在一盆水里放入几件物体。木块和塑料", "瓶盖会漂浮。鹅卵石、玻璃弹珠和钢钉会沉到", "盆底。物体是漂浮还是下沉，也是它", "材料的性质。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % the basin", "  \\fill[omWater!80] (0,0) rectangle (9,2.2);", "  \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.8pt] (-0.1,2.7) -- (0,2.6) -- (0,0) -- (9,0)", "    -- (9,2.6) -- (9.1,2.7);", "  % floating: wooden block, plastic cap", "  \\fill[brown!55, draw=brown!70!black] (0.8,2.0) rectangle (2.2,2.5);", "  \\fill[red!70, draw=red!50!black] (3.7,2.05) rectangle (4.3,2.35);", "  % sunk: pebble, marble, nail", "  \\fill[black!35, draw=black!60] (5.0,0.25) ellipse (0.45 and 0.22);", "  \\shade[ball color=cyan!40] (6.5,0.2) circle (0.18);", "  \\fill[black!55] (7.6,0.06) rectangle (8.6,0.14);", "  \\fill[black!55] (7.52,0.02) rectangle (7.62,0.18);", "  % labels", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (1.5,2.75) {木块};", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (4.0,2.75) {塑料瓶盖};", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (5.0,-0.1) {鹅卵石};", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (6.5,-0.1) {玻璃弹珠};", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (8.1,-0.1) {钢钉};", "  \\node[anchor=west, align=left] at (9.3,2.2) {会漂浮};", "  \\node[anchor=west, align=left] at (9.3,0.2) {会下沉};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 盆中水里：木块和塑料瓶盖漂浮；", "鹅卵石、玻璃弹珠和钢钉下沉。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{材料的分类}", "", "\\begin{method}[按一种性质分类]\\label{met:g1:materials-around-us:sort}", "对一堆物体进行分类：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 选择\\textbf{一个}问题，例如", "        “磁铁会吸住它吗？”；", "  \\item 逐一检验每件物体，并把它放入“能”组", "        或“不能”组；", "  \\item 如需要，可再用另一个问题把每组重新分类。", "\\end{enumerate}", "每次只用一个问题：这样，每件物体都恰好有一个位置。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omDef, line width=1pt] (0,0) circle (2.3);", "  \\draw[omProp, line width=1pt] (2.4,0) circle (2.3);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small\\bfseries] at (-0.6,2.65) {由金属制成};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\small\\bfseries] at (3.0,2.65) {被磁铁吸引};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (-1.1,0.35) {饮料罐};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (-1.1,-0.35) {铜丝};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (1.2,0.6) {钢钉};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (1.2,0) {铁钥匙};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (1.2,-0.6) {回形针};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (3.5,0) {（无）};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (5.2,0.9) {木勺};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (5.2,0.3) {玻璃弹珠};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (5.2,-0.3) {羊毛围巾};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (5.2,-0.9) {鹅卵石};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个问题，两个圈。蓝圈内：由金属", "制成的物体。橙圈内：能被磁铁吸引的物体。", "两圈重叠处：铁或钢制成的物体。两圈之外：其余一切。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{center}", "\\small", "\\begin{tabular}{lccc}", "\\hline", "物体（材料） & 是否坚硬？ & 是否透明？ & 能否被磁铁吸引？ \\\\", "\\hline", "木块（木材） & 是 & 否 & 否 \\\\", "钢钉（钢） & 是 & 否 & 是 \\\\", "玻璃弹珠（玻璃） & 是 & 是 & 否 \\\\", "瓶盖（塑料） & 是 & 否 & 否 \\\\", "纸片（纸） & 否 & 否 & 否 \\\\", "围巾（羊毛） & 否 & 否 & 否 \\\\", "鹅卵石（石头） & 是 & 否 & 否 \\\\", "\\hline", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "", "\\section{为用途选择合适的材料}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[每种材料都根据其性质来选择]\\label{prop:g1:materials-around-us:choose}", "人们根据物体必须完成的任务来选择它的材料：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 窗户必须让光透进来：它由玻璃制成，玻璃", "        是透明的；", "  \\item 雨衣必须挡住雨水并且能够折叠：它由", "        塑料或水无法透过的织物制成；", "  \\item 锅在炉灶上不能熔化：它由金属制成；", "  \\item 锅柄不能烫手：它常由木头", "        或硬塑料制成，这两者不会像金属那样烫手；", "  \\item 枕头必须柔软：它由填充了羽毛", "        或纤维的织物制成。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}